{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.115.170","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.115.170","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.170","content_hash":"001479fb2d91db4633386455901b4dac7d59b6a5c8b4fbe438b00f4600fa56fa","heading":"Flea market promoter – Records.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.170:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.170","text":"Each licensee shall keep accurate records of the names and addresses of each flea market seller, together with a brief description of the type of merchandise offered for sale. The licensee shall, upon request by a law enforcement officer or the City Clerk, submit such records for inspection. (Ord. 20039 § 17, 12-6-16.)\nCross References: Police Department, TMC 2.20.090 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"a5a3a57d-30bb-5d24-a532-25e75f558a5d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.170","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.170","content_hash":"2b51eb51cac4ce1b752fe3c01363b0a9f521d097ec69388917ff0b67304ac344","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.170:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.170:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.170","text":"Each licensee shall keep accurate records of the names and addresses of each flea market seller, together with a brief description of the type of merchandise offered for sale. The licensee shall, upon request by a law enforcement officer or the City Clerk, submit such records for inspection. (Ord. 20039 § 17, 12-6-16.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ac61fc